    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2895a7b6b322839592fe610",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉可能与我终生为敌的她，\n要她作为我的强敌，下定决心与我并驾齐驱！\n……而这句话也可以用来警惕我自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf392137b6d11f37a558b4a4cf56e12f15c7f338afe2e8cdc0248ad9131c052",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
