    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91327c345922294dec4c255d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今达成的霸业，改变了旁人看我的眼光。\n紧迫逼人的战术，阻挡了我的奔驰本色。\n啊啊！这正是适合王者勇往直前的荆棘之路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0260dbfcdfed76a72e7b3d597c62e9a010b3bef724f83b558b4e072f7d5c2f5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
