      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而怒涛也就此下定了决心。\n不是与我为敌……而是互相切磋琢磨的关系。\n她想成为我“终生的对手”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6f49b6827faa22f55e43376ebb775d6ec57293054482202fbbe3b387c1a092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015426.json",
      "json_path": [
