      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一个好对手――对王者而言确实不可或缺。\n这都是为了获得打倒“黄金世代”的力量！\n……好，这下舞台布置完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee8f400a465c4e17c08a8562e2cd7720aae3fd66ea5d5634cc1a646fc7b5b79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
